<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>SPAM NOTICE</strong></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you received a notice that states:</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">"Action Required: Application for Zoning Change" from Mark Dravillas (or any other staff person), Planning &amp; Zoning Commission, City of Columbus,  90 West Broad Street Columbus, Ohio 43215, please do not respond to the email.  The email is <strong>SPAM</strong>. If you have a question about fees for any active rezoning or variance application, contact <a href="mailto:zoninginfo@columbus.gov" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">zoninginfo@columbus.gov</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We apologize for any inconvenience.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">###</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
