</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"> </p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong><u>Online Rezoning Application – Starting September 15, 2025</u></strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>The Department of Building and Zoning Services is now offering online submission of rezoning applications through the <a href="https://portal.columbus.gov/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Citizen Access Portal</a>.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Review the following “How-To” guide:  <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/files/sharedassets/city/v/1/building-and-zoning/document-library/how-to-guide-online-rezoning-application.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://www.columbus.gov/files/sharedassets/city/v/1/building-and-zoning/document-library/how-to-guide-online-rezoning-application.pdf</a></strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Contact <a href="mailto:zoninginfo@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">zoninginfo@columbus.gov</a> with any questions, and include “Online Rezoning Application” in the subject line.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>###</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
